some
signal to the graphics board.
BTW, an AXPpci33 runs perfectly well with only 2 SIMMs. It has to be
true parity FP-RAM, though. (I was lucky and found 2 SIMMs with 64MB
each... FP and parity. Oh boy, I was soo proud ;-) Every once in a while
they
also try to get rid of some on eBay. It's well worth the try.

