Hardware setup:

Case: no-name minitower AT, 200 Watts power-supply + 80mm front intake
Mainboard: Digital AXPpci OEM (1994) with 166 MHz CPU
RAM: 2 * IBM 72 pins SIMMS 60 ns parity 16 MB
Video: Genoa Videoblitz 3AV, 2 MB VRAM, PCI, S3 Vision 968
Sound: Terratec Base 1, 16 bits ISA
