CDROM: Cyberdrive 120 S, 12 speed, SCSI
Harddrive: DPES-301080, 5400 RPM, 1,08 GB
Cache: no cache memory installed
Monitor: Compaq 14", 640*480@60Hz max.

Only 5,5 / 12 Volts connector used, left the 3,3 Volts alone.
Checked all jumpers on the mainboard several times.

Problem: When I connect everything and turn on the power, the fans start 
running, power led lights up, harrdrive initializes, 3,3 V regulator 
