- I tried two other 16 Bits ISA Videocard (an OAK and an ACU M....)
- Tried PCI slot 1 & 3 for PCI grpahics, tried ISA slots 1 & 4 for ISA 
graphics.
- tried a lower CPU frequency.

Has anybody an idea or suggestion, except for testing the RAM? Or the 
mainboard just being broken. (I tested the videocards today they're 
working properly).

Thanks in advance!

greetings
