>Is anybody using this type of setup ? Can you tell me how you set it
>up ? Maybe I should use another terminal emulator ?

I use kermit (AFAIK, minicom starts kermit anyway..) with this
configuration file (~/.kermrc):

set carrier-watch off
set line /dev/ttyS1
set speed 9600
set modem type direct
set prompt Kermit@\v(host)> 
set flow xon/xoff

Works for me,

